Without `--set` the template reads the config as merged from the tiers, so the shipped core default
reaches the body. This is the baseline its `--set` sibling moves.

-- fixtures/cwd/probe.md.j2 --
threshold {{ config.core.sprint.default_threshold_sp }}
-- cmd --
booping render /proc/self/cwd/probe.md.j2
-- exit --
0
-- stdout --
threshold 35
-- stderr --
